[h1]Hello Everybody, animal breeding is finally here![/h1]

[h1]Patch Notes:[/h1]
[list][*]Starting with this update, animals will be able to breed. To obtain offsprings you will need a breeding center (craftable at the advanced workshop) and a pair of fertile animals (same species/same breed). Each fertile species will recieve at least one rare coat color obtainable only trough breeding. For now, only 13 species are breedable, but the list will increase with each update. Multiple breeding centers can be active at the same time;
[*]Save System improvements were made;
[*]Eight new farms/settlements were added;
[*]New premade enclosures were added;
[*]New animal shelters and decorative items were added;
[*]New treasures were adeed;
[*]New colors for sunset and sunrise were added;
[*]All the tasks can now be completed;
[*]Some crafting recipes were updated;
[*]Some prices were updated;
[*]Some models and textures were updated;
[*]Cultsberg can now be cleansed 100%;
[*]Multiple visual glitches were fixed;
[*]Decreased volume for sounds like rain, storm, shotgun, mining and chopping;
[*]Fixed several monster spawners in Corpse Harbor and Akhali Desert.
[*]BUGFiX: Dragging and dropping an item in the same slot wasn't possible;
[*]BUGFiX: Pressing ESC key while sleeping caused the game to enter in an infinite loop;
[*]BUGFiX: Naming containers with the letter J wasn't possible;
[*]BUGFiX: Some containers not saving the items inside;
[*]BUGFiX: Aggro sheeps are no longer aggro;
[*]BUGFiX: Broken code when showing text of special items on the bottom right corner;
[*]BUGFiX: Consumable items from storage containers had the visual effect on;
[*]BUGFiX: Companions on follow used to duplicate after each load;
[*]BUGFiX: Credits pick-up from containers didn't work properly;
[*]BUGFiX: Items bought from shops weren't properly tracked;
[*] BUGFiX: Container to Inventory transfer issue, with the "to inventory" button, causing some items to vanish when the number of the available slots was under the number of the items that required transfer;

[h1]v4.4b + v4.4c:[/h1]
