[h1]Hello Everybody![/h1]

It's been a while since our last patch so we thought is time to show you a small preview for the next update.

Alpha 4.0 is probably the largest update so far and it will include:

[*]Full combat revamp with updated models and animations for weapons;
[*]New redesigned inventory system;
[*]Several new maps;
[*]Over 20 new animals;
[*]New items and recipes;
[*]New enemies;
[*]Remade spawn points for all creatures;
[*]A lot more story elements;

We estimate that the update will go live by the end of the next month.
Thank you for your support and patience!

