[h1]Animallica Alpha v2.20 is live:[/h1]

Hello everyone,

[h1]First of all, we are very excited to announce you that only for this weekend, Animallica is free to play! So, if you have friends that want to try out Animallica, this is their chance![/h1]

[img]http://cdn.edgecast.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/29389889/bc540c73e6fcf35a99e9eca934162f7864b2fbdf.jpg[/img]

With this occasion we have prepared a new update packed with several major changes:

One of them is melee combat improvement. All weapons and tools received several new animations making fighting and farming a lot more fluid. A rebalance for all the weapons and tools will come in the following patches.

Another important change is that now, most of the animals you will find in the wild show signs of infection on their skin. As always, you can cure them at the Laboratory after you catch them with tranquilizer arrows. Then, you can keep them in your base, use them as companions, or release them again in the wilderness to repopulate.
The spawning system for animals was also replaced, and they will not keep respawning like before.

Pestilentia received a facelift and now you can find a "mutant factory" in the middle of the map.

Other improvements:
[*] Recycle Bins were added in Land Base, Corpse Harbor, Cultsberg and Sliceland. Use them to recycle/sell unwanted items.
[*] A katana was added into the game and it can be bought from the Madman;
[*] Most of the locations were updated;
[*] New recipes, mostly furniture, were added; 
[*] Increased stamina regeneration; Stamina also regenerates when you walk;
[*] Crafting time was reduced for some items;
[*] Increased sleeping time from 8 hours to 12;
[*] +10 weapons and tools have now a slight increase in attack speed;
[*] Wall torches cast light again. Be aware that placing too many of them will drop performance;
[*] The Christmas tree and Christmas gifts were removed from Sliceland and they will be relocated in one of the next patches;
[*] Fixed the bug that was preventing the player to pick up objects in the vicinity of the horse, after dismounting.
[*] Fixed missing crosshair after incomplete loot;
[*] Fixed key bind page;
[*] Several models were replaced;
[*] Several terrain textures were replaced;
[*] Some shaders were updated;
[*] Tweaked camera effects;
[*] Draw distance was doubled;
[*] Fixed a rare teleport bug, causing the game to freeze;
[*] Fixed the crafting bug that was showing the items green all the time;
[*] Fixed a recipe bug – the recipe wasn’t properly updated after loading a save file;
[*] Adjusted Dorado Saloon doors;
[*] Fixed a broken ladder in Corpse Harbor;
[*] Some creatures were renamed;
[*] Some prices and recipes were adjusted;
[*] Fixed several spelling errors.

[h1]Hotfix 2.2.b:[/h1]

[*]Fixed a bug with one of the new chair recipe;
[*]Lowered sell value for antibiotics and painkillers;
[*]Water level in Sliceland was lowered by 0.5 m;
[*]Tuned down stamina drain while running;
[*]Fixed zoom animation on bows and crossbow;

[h1]Please use the verify files option from your steam client before you start the game, after any patch. Sometimes, the files are not updated properly.[/h1]

